    {"Question": "What’s the `global` keyword?", "Answer": "Declares a variable as global inside a function.\n\n**Example:**\n```python\nx = 1\ndef inc():\n    global x\n    x += 1\ninc()\nprint(x)  # 2\n```\n\nAvoid overuse."},
